  bv_unsigned (edenot E e) = v -> a' = a + off -> L5.u64_at RSEGS M a' v.
Proof.
ltac2:(KReplay.run1 (kr_t_PnARiPL2 ()) [] (Mh_0198_blobs1.kr_b_086 ())). Qed.
